WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.550
Rain falls over the night city. Headlights reflect on wet streets.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:15.500
Waves roll across the coast beneath the morning sunlight.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:23.500
Water ripples and swirls in close-up, catching the light.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:31.250
Wind lifts sand across sunlit desert ridges.
